    "body": "Stopped at reproduction, without a production change or PR.\n\nOn upstream/main db091cb38163f3713ce44918ea973855cd0960ad, cumulative_inscribe_cap_reproduction_1570 passed on unchanged code. It checked 144 faces: 16 stadium resolutions, four notch depths and four hole depths, each at three rotations and two offsets. Accepted fits stayed within 5% draw-in per side. Every eligible first shrink left at most FIT_TOL overshoot on the second pass.\n\nfit() keeps the centre endpoints fixed. Every face_overshoot term is the radius plus a fixed signed distance. Subtracting the measured overshoot from the radius clears all positive terms in one pass, apart from rounding. I could not produce the required failing pin, so I stopped as instructed. The issue remains open and the claim is released.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
